  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p>• About our brand and products</p><p>King Write develops battery-free EMR styluses. Our flagship MR05 passive pen works with reMarkable, Kindle Scribe, Samsung Galaxy Tab S*, Wacom One, Quaderno and other EMR devices. It supports 4096 pressure levels, tilt recognition and palm rejection, equipped with built-in eraser and shortcut button. Available in multiple colors, including replacement nibs, covered by a 1-year warranty.</p><p>Official link: https://kingwrite.com/products/mr05-emr-stylus-pen</p><p>• What makes us different</p><p>No charging or Bluetooth pairing, ready to use out of the box. Wide cross-device compatibility. Affordable substitute for expensive official brand pens. Ergonomic design for long-hour writing and drawing, with durable replaceable nibs.</p><p>• How affiliates can earn</p><p>You get commissions on orders driven by your affiliate link or exclusive coupon.</p><p>Marketplace General Program: 10% commission, open for creator applications.</p><p>Premium KOL Program: 15% commission, invite-only.</p><p>Tracking cookie lasts 90 days. </p><p>• How to promote us</p><p>Target audiences: e-ink tablet users, digital artists, students, medical &amp; office staff.</p><p>Create product reviews, comparison videos, buying guides and workflow content. We provide official product images, specs and exclusive discount codes for your audience.</p><p>• Other information</p><p>Free samples are available only to qualified creators. Send your social links, audience data and shipping address to info@kingwrite.com to apply. Approved creators need to publish authentic reviews after receiving samples.</p></div></div>",
